Rule 3 (shape values must fit within int32 upper bound)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if shape(v_1, 0) = 0 then true else max(v_1) ≤ 2147483647
>>
Rule 4 (dtype must be a valid tensor data type, not np.dtype)
{v_1 : dtype} |= 0 ≤ v_1 ∧ v_1 ≤ 11
>>
Rule 5 (operation name must be chosen from the allowed string set)
{v_1 : str} |= v_1 = "none" ∨ v_1 = "sum" ∨ v_1 = "max" ∨ v_1 = "min" ∨ v_1 = "prod"
>>
Rule 6 (init is a boolean flag)
{v_1 : bool} |= v_1 = true ∨ v_1 = false
>>
Rule 7 (non-negativity of the length of the shape vector via rank-based quantification)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) ≥ 0
